# Input

```scss
@use "sass:list";
@use "sass:meta";
@use "sass:map";

$x:(); .case-shape-empty { length:list.length($x); separator:list.separator($x); bracketed:list.is-bracketed($x); type:meta.type-of($x);  }

```


# Formatted

```scss
@use "sass:list";
@use "sass:meta";
@use "sass:map";

$x: ();
.case-shape-empty {
	length: list.length($x);
	separator: list.separator($x);
	bracketed: list.is-bracketed($x);
	type: meta.type-of($x);
}

```
